--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_WeierstrassCurve_exists_lift_lawIso_quotient_maximalIdeal_pow_succ_of_exists.lean

